=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  accounts login-not-read --------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. A host with a login record hardn$
# can't read, here lslogins not installed: the last section says$
# so and lists no one.$
$
# Account Review ###############################################$
$
  Empty password -----------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] carol                Run passwd -l carol$
$
  Password never expires ---------------------------------------$
$
   -  None$
$
  No login in 90 days ------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Can't read the login record$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

